# --- PCMM/Duct_Dev/scripts: generated outputs, not source ---
# Matches Outputs/ and logs/ folders and *.log files at any depth under scripts/
# (e.g. Figures/Figure1/Outputs/, Figures/logs/, future Model_Evaluation/*/Outputs/, etc.)
/PCMM/Duct_Dev/scripts/**/Outputs/
/PCMM/Duct_Dev/scripts/**/output/
/PCMM/Duct_Dev/scripts/**/logs/
/PCMM/Duct_Dev/scripts/**/*.log

